  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Virtual PCF pattern preserved. React 16 + Fluent 9 platform-libraries. No bundling regression.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Shared PolymorphicPicker consumption preserved. Do NOT modify the shared component.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021 Path A exception">The `title` Griffel block DELIBERATELY uses hardcoded values (Segoe UI stack, 14px, #242424, padding 4px 0px, weight 600) to match Dataverse OOB section-header EXACTLY. This is the documented owner-approved Path A exception (SRFR-034 §4, extended by SRFR-037). All other styles remain on Fluent v9 semantic tokens per ADR-021.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Feature preservation: manual refresh button (SRFR-034), auto-refresh (SRFR-035), showVersionFooter (SRFR-034), PolymorphicPicker consumption (SRFR-030/034), CREATE-mode presave bridge (SRFR-032) — ALL preserved.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Backward compat: no manifest property additions/removals; existing v1.3.2 form bindings continue to function.</constraint>
    <constraint source="src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md — Version Update Checklist">ALL 7 anchors bumped together (manifest, index.ts, footer BUILD_DATE, solution.xml, Solution ControlManifest, package.json, pack.ps1).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">TypeScript strict mode.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>pcf/version-discipline + Fluent v9 Griffel styling + OOB Dataverse section-header parity</topic>
    <files>
      <file>src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md</file>
      <file>src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolverApp.tsx</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="OOB section-header parity" location="RegardingResolverApp.tsx `title` Griffel block">
        Owner DevTools inspection of the OOB "TRACKING" section header revealed:
        .pa-nn (padding 4px 0px), .pa-nl (font-size 14px), .pa-hw (font-weight
        600 semi-bold), .pa-de (Segoe UI stack), .pa-s (color rgb(36,36,36) =
        #242424). SRFR-034 briefing stated weight=400, which was incorrect.
        SRFR-037 corrects to weight=600.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Griffel directional padding to reduce top spacing" location="RegardingResolverApp.tsx `container` Griffel block">
        Replace uniform `padding: tokens.spacingHorizontalS` (8px all sides)
        with directional properties: paddingTop: 0, paddingRight/Bottom/Left
        at tokens.spacingHorizontalS. Reduces top spacing so the PCF title
        aligns with OOB section headers on the same form.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <context>
    <background>
      SRFR-035 deployed v1.3.2 with auto-refresh. Owner post-UAT DevTools
      inspection revealed two issues: (1) title font-weight is 400
      (incorrect per SRFR-034 briefing) but OOB actually uses 600
      (semi-bold); (2) the PCF's title has too much top padding compared to
      OOB section headers on the same form. This task lands as v1.3.3 to
      preserve v1.3.2 as the shipped baseline and fixes both issues.
    </background>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="SRFR-035" status="completed">v1.3.2 shipped with auto-refresh + manual refresh button + showVersionFooter.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
    <related-work>
      <item>SRFR-038 (parallel) — sprk_todo FormXml fix (name field visibility, field labels). Different files.</item>
    </related-work>
  </context>

  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context Check">Verify context &lt; 60%. Read current `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` `title` + `container` Griffel blocks. Confirm 7-anchor version state at 1.3.2.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Fix title font-weight">In `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` `useStyles.title`, change `fontWeight: 400` → `fontWeight: 600`. Leave font-family, font-size (14px), color (#242424), padding (4px 0px), letterSpacing, textTransform unchanged.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Reduce root top padding">In `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` `useStyles.container`, replace the single `padding: tokens.spacingHorizontalS` line with directional: `paddingTop: 0`, `paddingRight: tokens.spacingHorizontalS`, `paddingBottom: tokens.spacingHorizontalS`, `paddingLeft: tokens.spacingHorizontalS`. This reduces the ~8px extra top gap so the title aligns with OOB section-header row.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Update docstring">Bump v1.3.2 references to v1.3.3 in the file docstring header. Add a "# v1.3.3 (SRFR-037 title-styling fix)" section noting (a) font-weight 400 → 600 per actual OOB DevTools inspection and (b) root container top-padding reduced to 0 for OOB section-header top alignment.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Version bump — Location 1 (ControlManifest.Input.xml)">Update `version="1.3.3"` on the control root element.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Version bump — Location 2 (index.ts CONTROL_VERSION)">Update `CONTROL_VERSION = '1.3.3'`.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Version bump — Location 3 (BUILD_DATE)">Confirm `BUILD_DATE = '2026-07-03'` (same day as v1.3.2; leave unchanged).</step>
    <step order="7" name="Version bump — Location 4 (Solution manifest)">Update `Solution/solution.xml` `&lt;Version&gt;` element to `1.3.3`.</step>
    <step order="8" name="Version bump — Location 5 (Solution Control Manifest)">Update `Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Controls.RegardingResolver/ControlManifest.xml` version attribute to `1.3.3`.</step>
    <step order="9" name="Version bump — Location 6 (package.json)">Update `package.json` `"version": "1.3.3"`.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Version bump — Location 7 (pack.ps1)">Update `$version = "1.3.3"`.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Tests — bulk version + new coverage">
      In `__tests__/RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx`:
      (a) Bulk replace 1.3.2 → 1.3.3 (version prop and version regex).
      (b) Add test: title element's className carries the Griffel atomic class
          for font-weight 600 (assertion approach: query the title element
          and use `window.getComputedStyle(el).fontWeight` to verify 600 via
          Griffel's injected stylesheet).
    </step>
    <step order="12" name="Grep verification">Grep for `1.3.2` under `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/` (exclude node_modules + out + Solution/bin). Assert zero non-history hits.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="Quality Gate">Invoke `/code-review` and `/adr-check` on modified files: ControlManifest.Input.xml, index.ts, RegardingResolverApp.tsx, solution.xml, extracted ControlManifest.xml, package.json, pack.ps1, RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx. Address findings or escalate per CLAUDE.md §6.5.</step>
    <step order="13" name="Build">Run `npm run build:prod` in `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/`. Confirm build passes.</step>
    <step order="14" name="Test run">Run `npm test`. Confirm all tests pass (54 SRFR-035 + 1 new SRFR-037 = 55 expected).</step>
    <step order="15" name="Copy bundle + pack solution">Copy `out/controls/RegardingResolver/bundle.js` to `Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Controls.RegardingResolver/bundle.js`. Run `Solution/pack.ps1` to produce `Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.3.zip`.</step>
    <step order="16" name="Deploy">Run `pac solution import --path Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.3.zip --force-overwrite --publish-changes` against spaarkedev1. Verify via `pac solution list | Select-String RegardingResolver` shows Version 1.3.3.</step>
    <step order="17" name="Update Task Status">Update SRFR-037 status → completed, notes summary. Update TASK-INDEX.md — add row for SRFR-037 under Wave 3 as another follow-on. Reset current-task.md.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
