  <notes><![CDATA[
Completed 2026-07-03. Title font-weight corrected 400 → 600 per actual OOB
DevTools inspection (SRFR-034 briefing incorrectly said 400). Root
container top padding reduced to 0 (directional: paddingTop 0, other three
sides preserved at spacingHorizontalS) so the RELATED RECORD title aligns
with OOB section-header row on the same form. 7-anchor version bump to
1.3.3. Tests: 55 passing (54 existing + 1 new SRFR-037 font-weight assertion
via window.getComputedStyle). Build (`npm run build:prod`) succeeded with
1.57 MiB bundle parity vs v1.3.2. Deploy succeeded: `pac solution list`
shows RegardingResolverSolution v1.3.3. Quality gates: code-review PASS
(targeted styling delta only); adr-check PASS (ADR-021 Path A exception
preserved and TIGHTENED with actual OOB values; ADR-022 platform-libs
preserved; ADR-012 shared PolymorphicPicker untouched; ADR-024 resolver
unchanged). SRFR-034/035 features (refresh button, auto-refresh,
showVersionFooter, CREATE-mode presave bridge, PolymorphicPicker
consumption) all preserved. See notes/task-037-regarding-resolver-title-styling.log.
  ]]></notes>
</task>
